{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1000_p", "source_sha256": "39e9410b087641dc93898da423beffb7ea8f4e0d53d324670f3202f88d0c335e", "ja": "（仕事で、千早達を連れ雪山へやってきた。\n今は各々が自由時間を楽しんでいる）", "zh": "（因为工作，带着千早她们来到了雪山。现在大家都在享受各自的自由时间。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b7696348606af35944059f95b866959dc4376f775471e2f0b96d1f158a548973", "ja": "……綺麗なメロディだな。\nなんて曲なんだ？", "zh": "……好优美的旋律啊。\n是什么歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "72f573df986e3bee75bb496f3ec33e2558017ae10059fd731542e8070e8f82b7", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nいえ、とくに曲名があるわけではないです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n没什么，只是这首曲子还没有名字。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "d8097fada2d15b503cb4250ca5dbf5b5e284e94692e7635b912d7b7f492383a7", "ja": "少し休憩して、景色を見ていたんですが、\nそうしたら自然と旋律が浮かんできて。ふふっ。", "zh": "我稍微休息了一下，看着周围的景色，\n不知不觉脑海中就浮现出了旋律。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1005_p", "source_sha256": "846c979f7704cf527811c9f1f3554e1d4fb076424be763c683328cc898d5bc39", "ja": "なるほど、そうなのか。でもそれなら、\n千早も結構楽しんでくれているって事かな？", "zh": "原来如此，是这样啊。不过既然这样，千早也算是玩得挺开心的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "66f2891f1c025f12a6d039e8d890b6fb761ec6749f6e54c85792342cc1bd9cbb", "ja": "そうですね……。はい、楽しんでいると思います。\nやっぱり、こういう時間がもてるのは嬉しいですから。", "zh": "是啊……我想，我确实很享受其中。\n毕竟，能拥有这样的时光，还是很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "2f7fe2b4f257cecd37be1d8129262e00845c39929eb7afddcf23a48e46cc46b9", "ja": "それと、たぶん、この気持ちは……\n高山さんのおかげが大きいのかもしれません。", "zh": "还有，或许，这份心情……\n也有很大一部分要归功于高山。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0b74e2f1838e4c80499678dd90552b05bae944b61092b77d68da3e72407f908d", "ja": "ん？　紗代子がどうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯？纱代子怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "2af15abb6bf74650b8f4ca4b400918055cd0ee665fb7835abbe6f836340925b5", "ja": "たいしたことではないんですけど、\nさっき少し、高山さんにスキーを教えていたんです。", "zh": "没什么大不了的，只是刚才教了高山同学一会儿滑雪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "3151431d1f849d347cdfc6b1b2cb684d2ee2608107141c2b2377b36341edda92", "ja": "彼女、最初は何度も転んでいたんですけど、\n全然めげなくて……むしろ、とっても楽しそうで。", "zh": "她一开始摔倒了好多次，\n却一点也没有气馁……反而看起来非常开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "4c4a5b70df5df45b9b26b89fe3fc41f65e62a2cd55c4eff553e58f6c1963350b", "ja": "彼女のそんな姿を見ていたら、私までなんだか楽しくて\n……なんだか幸せな気持ちになって。", "zh": "看着她那副样子，不知怎的连我也觉得很开心\n……心里也总觉得格外幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ec1364656028b0bd0e1ee50ae9ee69f598da51e404a8b1c1caf9e8dc22ba7b8b", "ja": "なるほど、そんな事があったのか。\nふたりが楽しんでくれたみたいで良かったよ。", "zh": "原来如此，发生过这样的事啊。\n看到你们两个人都那么开心，我也就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "e2474e89bbb474ca6a8fe1389ca820da30c1de79f6d954d50c2b1ef162a1af4c", "ja": "言葉ではなんて表現したらいいかわかりませんが、\nそんな気持ちが歌になってこぼれそうな感じがして。", "zh": "我不知道该如何用语言表达，但总觉得那样的心情仿佛快要化作歌声流淌出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "690401b5e9530121b487020cf6afe35219615111b4397e0cb721ce2bbf7ff4cf", "ja": "……なんて、ごめんなさい。\n突然こんなことを言っても困りますよね。", "zh": "……我说这些，对不起。\n突然跟您说这些，让您很为难吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3264ff5531a71afcf1e0c574ea1f5e89486455778cc8fcdd10ac83fe253a2bd5", "ja": "いや、そんな事ないよ。\n俺もその歌を是非聞いてみたいと思う。", "zh": "不，没那回事。\n我也很想听听那首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "b188cc439364d9bc62d442b9d9b7028054e54bca66a9313c956abd276a4ca021", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nそう言ってもらえると、嬉しいです。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n您能这么说，我很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "6484c11604e8d985b596fc9388cc5cb2ae8fe303e168ccdc08ed2d36128c194d", "ja": "あの、少しだけ……\n本当に、お言葉に甘えても良いでしょうか？", "zh": "那个，稍微……\n真的可以，恭敬不如从命吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2fc9a924e06be4c8d8892ec722414737e93ed1b4e0dc58537d105e62131ff98b", "ja": "もちろん。こちらからお願いしたくらいなんだから。\n少しと言わず、千早の思うままを聞かせてほしいな。", "zh": "当然了，毕竟是我这边主动拜托你的。\n别说一点了，千早想说什么都尽管告诉我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "be01a2f2f55050372226f8faaa627eeb28e99078b1f6d92ad51f5190a0683f1d", "ja": "よかった。ありがとうございます。\n{$P$}に、聞いてほしいです。", "zh": "太好了。谢谢您。\n我想唱给{$P$}听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0264_1020_p", "source_sha256": "bfd2989d2452877e195d37ae91cbb94516fb3582cdc8fce6f54c3d9419de35d9", "ja": "（そうして、千早はゆっくりと歌いだした。\n優しい歌声が、雪空に溶けていくようだ……）", "zh": "（就这样，千早缓缓唱起了歌。温柔的歌声，仿佛融入了雪夜的天空……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
